am driver tries to  infiltrate the Ku Klux Klan critics were  roundly amazed by Lee's mastery of tone  as he abused dramatic high-stakes  situations with his singular Sensibility  Digital spy's Hugh Armitage summed up  this consensus neatly calling the film a  roller coaster that is laugh-out-loud  winning isn't shocking you into stunned  silence a damn fine and funny piece of  entertainment and a testament to Lee's  skills as an artist crazy rich Asians  directed by Jon M Chu crazy rich Asians  features Constance Wu leading a nearly  all Asian cast to tell the story of a  native New Yorker who accompanies her  boyfriend to a wedding in Singapore soon  after its release it became a surprise  critical smash with all the trappings of  a genuine cultural phenomenon reviewer  Randy Jones encapsulated the critics  consensus by concluding that crazy rich  Asians takes familiar tropes  and revitalizes them and its entire  genre a great cast amazing direction and  powerful writing  like black panther before it crazy rich  Asians constitutes a clear message to  Hollywood execs that heartfelt well  executed stories featuring people of  color can not only cross cultural  boundaries but smash them and earn huge  box office returns in the process
 

